items.summary:
A 68-year-old Russian man swam down the Nemunas River from Russia’s Kaliningrad exclave to 🇱🇹Lithuania to seek asylum, only to be returned to Russia.
Was the send-back:
A) Legitimate enforcement of border control / security risk management;
B) Inhuman behaviour;
C) Strategic hint for Spanish authorities;
D) Other?

